00:07:52,750 --> 00:08:00,030
unbelievable success and i don't think you people can realize uh how much success it was and

52
00:08:00,030 --> 00:08:07,230
because it was in the few of us who had not accepted the

53
00:08:07,230 --> 00:08:18,880
The government gospel, not because, let me say, we were terribly impressed by the way

