00:08:36,420 --> 00:08:40,090
think that government knew the questions.

58
00:08:40,090 --> 00:08:51,280
few of us, and you have no idea how few we were, were terribly. It was a period of great elation

59
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:57,120
when you saw what happened in Europe, and then you saw a few years later what happened in Japan,

60
00:08:57,760 --> 00:09:05,440
and a few years later, the biggest development boom history has ever known got going in South

61
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:12,080
America. At the risk of offending you, South America is the success story of this century,

