00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:34,860
we were sure, once and for all, settled the social problem of the 19th century.

76
00:11:35,900 --> 00:11:38,380
We invented the modern pension fund.

77
00:11:39,820 --> 00:11:45,620
Now, in this room, there's a representative of a much older version of TIAA, the teachers,

