00:14:28,270 --> 00:14:35,070
know where the interests are he didn't believe us and i have an unhappy suspicion that he was right

98
00:14:35,070 --> 00:14:38,550
that they really believed it was free.

99
00:14:39,670 --> 00:14:43,010
And so we went into a plan, which at the time,

100
00:14:43,130 --> 00:14:44,790
I don't think we know, we knew,

101
00:14:45,370 --> 00:14:48,900
but we suspected that if it worked,

102
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:53,300
it would be copied and it would convert,

103
00:14:53,660 --> 00:14:56,890
and this was why we wanted it.

104
00:14:56,890 --> 00:15:00,430
It would solve the problem of the 19th century,

105
00:15:00,950 --> 00:15:04,030
