00:15:04,030 --> 00:15:13,510
by socializing ownership in the large publicly held corporation

107
00:15:13,510 --> 00:15:15,770
without nationalizing it.

108
00:15:15,770 --> 00:15:21,010
And you know, it's been the greatest success of any social innovation

