00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:53,860
Today, Japanese life expectancies, you know, are larger, longer than ours.

142
00:17:53,860 --> 00:18:07,310
But the main reason was that they said after 20 or 30 years in which unemployment in Japan reached up to 50 percent in the 30s,

143
00:18:07,690 --> 00:18:12,490
employment security is the first need.

144
00:18:13,010 --> 00:18:20,070
